#: ../../source/libraries/images.rst:34
msgid "The available Handlers are as follows:"
msgstr "사용 가능한 핸들러는 다음과 같습니다:"

#: ../../source/libraries/images.rst:36
msgid "``gd``      The GD/GD2 image library"
msgstr "``gd``      GD/GD2 이미지 라이브러리"

#: ../../source/libraries/images.rst:37
msgid "``imagick`` The ImageMagick library."
msgstr "``imagick`` ImageMagick 라이브러리."

#: ../../source/libraries/images.rst:39
